WEBVTT

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.190
Are you watching, boss 
of the Sealing Faction?

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.650
Come on down!

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.110
We'll settle this!

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.280
Yes, sir. Displaying video.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.370
It's huge!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.250
Is that the Sealing Faction's boss?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.660
"He didn't need to make his image so big."

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.300
"He hates losing at anything, doesn't he?"

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.210
That's what Sensei says.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>"I sent you coordinates."</i>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.750
<i>"Let us fight in a week,
at the location I just gave you,</i>

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>when we've both had a chance to recover."</i>

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.600
<i>So says the Generalissimo.</i>

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.620
Was that Shiraishi-san's voice?

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:51.440
She was supposedly part of
 the Sealing Faction to begin with.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.880
<i>Sorry, Kumashiro-san, Inaba-san!</i>

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.260
<i>I'll send a map to your phones.</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.730
<i>If you want, you can come watch, too.</i>

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:06.330
Why does she sound like a friend 
inviting us to the school festival?

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.410
Very well.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.300
We'll be there to watch the last battle, huh?

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:17.980
I've revived, but it turns out 
there's nothing for me to do!

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.740
Oh, Nezuya-kun.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.720
You're back.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.210
When did that happen?

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.420
Wait, I thought you moved.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:29.380
Oh, he was so far away he couldn't make it.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.230
So lame!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.920
Nezuya-senpai...

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.940
I'm glad. He's your friend, right?

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.070
Yeah.

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.310
We can't lose this fight, can we?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.230
<i>"Farewell. We will meet again."</i>

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:15.230
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.980
One Week Later

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.980
Somewhere in the Pacific

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.280
<b>Episode 10: Karellen and Rashaverak</b>

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.750
Torai-san and the others came.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.000
The old man didn't, though.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.380
I sent him the map...

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.130
Yeah.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:07.450
"It's been a long time since we've fought 
each other in the flesh, Rashaverak."

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.260
"Today's fight isn't a training match.
Are you ready?"

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.350
So says the Generalissimo.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.500
"What about you? Are you ready, Karellen?"

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.930
"It's been a long time since you've fought 
a real battle. Are you up for it?"

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:23.570
That's what Sensei says.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:27.070
Rasha...whatsits. Is that your name, Sensei?

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.150
Woof.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:33.430
"All the large sealing devices 
I brought were destroyed."

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:35.080
"But I still have this."

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.670
"An ultra-miniaturized sealing device."

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:41.050
"To win, you have to destroy this."

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:46.200
"And for me to win,
 I have to break your will."

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.850
"Not your body, but your will."

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.670
"And if it turns out your will 
is stronger than your body,

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.810
this island will mark your grave."

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:57.830
So says the Generalissimo.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.640
"Very well. Let us begin."

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.740
That's what Sensei says.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.730
Giga Cat...

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.320
Wepwawet...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.950
...Hammer!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.870
...Bite!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.740
"Primitive Siriusian,

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.750
don't think you can resolve 
everything with brute force."

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.390
So says the Generalissimo.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.710
You're one to talk.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:47.660
You're just another muscle-for-brains type, 
trying to solve his problems

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:50.090
with violence!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:57.940
Wow!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.260
He threw him again!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.230
Can he do that at that size?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.320
Damn it...

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.990
Kuroi-kun, you can do it!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.410
Fine.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.830
Sensei, let's do it.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:21.420
No, I know we've been drinking too much 
and that you don't want to do it, but...

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.800
Ginko, hand it over!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.310
Roger!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.290
Let's drink some too, Generalissimo!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.180
Generalissimo, this is the big fight!

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.140
Spaceship AI, give it to me!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.440
Sensei!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.080
Doping Mode!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:16.700
Giga Cat Blade!

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.310
Fenrir Fang!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:07.560
I refuse to let you beat me, Karellen!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:11.900
I shall surpass you, Rashaverak!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:29.690
Surpass me? What's gotten into you?

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.300
You're awfully humble today.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.350
You are strong.

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.760
I respect you.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:39.880
If you don't respect your opponent,

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.180
how can you give them your all?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:46.560
Then I shall become strong 
enough to match your hopes!

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:53.220
Wepwawet Howl!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:57.740
Giga Cat Hammer!

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:02.150
No matter who they are, you help them.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.940
No matter who they are, you believe them.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:07.250
You always put your life on 
the line for the thing you believe in.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.380
I wish I was like you.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:12.590
But!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:18.800
The universe will not be 
the way you want it to be.

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:22.550
That's why I'm doing what I have to do.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:25.770
Grow up and be an adult, Rashaverak!

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.700
Everyone in Nebula is an adult!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.940
Even a selfish man like me,

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.940
or you, who swallows his pain...

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:39.430
You and I just have different 
personalities, Karellen!

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:43.200
He's pushing us back!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.620
Nebula may be adults,
 but Earthlings are children.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.600
When a child chooses the wrong path in life,

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.460
it's the adults that have 
to take responsibility.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:58.300
Just shut up already, you stupid dog!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.590
"Stupid dog"?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.470
Sensei...

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:09.020
Sensei wants to save you, too!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.060
They're fighting in space?

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.380
Wow...

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.890
Who's winning?

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:45.720
Hell if I know.

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:51.690
I'm not even sure whose side I'm on now.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:57.220
The one thing I do know is that 
neither side has a place for me.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.940
If it hurts to not have a place to belong,

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.010
then once the battle's over,

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:08.130
let's go see my brother.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.080
Yosuke...

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.000
I'll think about it.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.790
It's okay.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.640
Kuroi-kun will stand up!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.120
He stood up.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.870
Get up off your ass, Sealing Faction!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.250
The fight's just starting!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.420
Spaceship AI!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.420
Spaceship AI!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.350
Gulp!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.190
Woof!

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:33.750
Let's go!

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:35.710
Here we go!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.590
They're huge...

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.060
It's dangerous to be on the ground!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:48.460
Everybody, retreat to the air!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:49.300
Okay!

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.150
Should we get back?

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.310
Yeah.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:17.800
Tera Cat...

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.840
...Hammer!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.220
Grand...

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.170
...Stella...

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:29.300
...Breaker!

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.180
We did it!

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.440
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.570
Here it comes...

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.520
Tera!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.190
Cat!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:48.460
Hammer!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.370
A tie?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.750
No, the Pacifists are off 
balance after their punch!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.250
The Sealing Faction can use 
their left hand weapon!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.750
Grand!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.880
Stella!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.590
Breaker!

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.130
I'll deflect it from below!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:09.930
Can I make it in time?

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.170
We're faster than he is!

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:11.930
It's over!

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.930
Hold it!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:14.890
That voice...

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.340
The old man?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.990
How is he so fast?

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.910
This is the last attack I'll ever do... 
and I'm putting all my body and soul into it!

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:33.740
Take this!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.830
Takezo-san?

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.210
This is for my son!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.000
No way...

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.960
Impossible!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:52.960
He cut through an interstellar 
strategic weapon?

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.680
That's what you get!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.180
You're wrong, old man!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.890
You want to kill me!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.300
I'm the one who killed your son!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:09.540
I know that!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:17.830
Kuroi-kun, don't worry about us.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.710
Go!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:19.970
Nezuya-senpai!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.250
Well done, Nezuya-kun!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.960
I'm so glad you're okay, old man.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:29.960
But if he put that much of his 
power into his psychic armor,

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.290
his body won't...

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.800
You okay, old man?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.140
Old man?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.270
"We'll blow a hole in the middle 
of them and head inside!"

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.730
That's what Sensei says!

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.110
Got it!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.040
Generalissimo!

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:50.110
Block... no, dodge! Now!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.330
A glancing blow?

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:02.290
We didn't hit hard enough!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.050
No, that's enough!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:08.540
Oh no!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:09.550
Shiraishi!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.610
Sensei!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.370
Generalissimo!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:44.080
Damn you, Rashaverak!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.920
It's over, Karellen!

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:06.350
I did this to stop a tragedy 
like Sirius or Riel

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.230
from ever happening again.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:15.500
You didn't need to dirty 
your hands to do it.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.290
You just needed to watch over them.

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.620
Nobody from Riel hated anyone

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.600
or wanted this planet to be sealed away.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.550
Your kind feelings are enough for us.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.510
Thank you, Generalissimo Karellen.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:42.220
Would you please watch over 
this planet a little more?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.960
If the Princess of Riel herself says so...

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.190
There's nothing I can say to that.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:55.440
The miniaturized sealing 
device was destroyed.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.320
We've lost.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.020
It's okay.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:03.240
I'm sure the people of this planet 
won't make the wrong choice.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:10.420
Because you showed them all kind dreams.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:15.280
You've really grown up, Siriusian boy.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:25.350
Good job, Kuroi-kun.

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.600
Are you okay, old man?

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.060
Answer me, old man!

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:39.620
No...

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.410
It can't be...

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.370
Old man, don't tell me you're...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.630
Hey, don't sleep here.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.920
You'll catch a cold.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.730
Don't hit me.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:03.740
I'm too hungry to move.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:06.200
I'm just going to live here...

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.930
He's alive.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.630
You can't live here!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:12.870
Yosuke, we'll go see Senpai later.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:17.360
At least, after I've had a chance 
to see my parents at home.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.070
Yeah.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.360
Hey. Glad it's over, guys.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.190
Hitsujitani-kun, Takatori...

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:28.390
You too.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:30.040
Yeah.

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:39.800
Since you all lost to me, 
you need to do what I say.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.280
What?

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.720
I didn't lose!

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:47.760
I didn't even fight.

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:51.740
About four or five years from now, I guess,

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.100
the dragon who sleeps on 
the dark side of the moon will awaken.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:59.320
The dragon? The one who 
destroyed your planet?

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:03.200
Help me defeat it.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.480
Impossible.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.690
Impossible!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:09.660
Nothing can survive space-time banishment.

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:15.060
And you're telling me it traveled 
through time to fifty years ago,

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:17.130
when it crashed into the moon and hibernated?

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:20.130
Why couldn't we find it?

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:24.300
Soya-kun, is one of the 
People of Paradise really here?

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.800
Like here? Here?

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.310
We'll fix up our ship,

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:33.430
get help from Nebula HQ...

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:35.690
Will we make it in time?

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.790
In four or five years, I'll be dead.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.320
Old man, that's not funny.

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:45.650
This'll do, right?

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:48.440
Thanks.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.800
<i>Approximately 80 percent of the population</i>

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:59.330
<i>recovered from the worldwide 
outbreak of comas.</i>

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:01.900
<i>Some still haven't woken up,</i>

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>but little by little, they will.</i>

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:10.730
<i>Crime rates and armed conflicts have 
started to decrease a little since then.</i>

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:14.300
<i>And the world's getting 
a little more peaceful.</i>

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.010
<i>And as time passed...</i>

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:23.830
Hey.

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:45.080
<b><i>Next
Azrabarakura</i></b>

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:44.980
"Azrabarakura."
